# React/Vite installation settings

| Setting | Required | Purpose |
|---|---:|---|
| `REPO_PATH` / `INSTALL_PATH` | yes | Build source and immutable Nginx content paths |
| `APP_UID` / `APP_GID` | yes | Numeric identity used by the unprivileged Nginx runtime |
| `APP_PORT` | yes | Loopback and container HTTP port |
| `VITE_API_BASE_URL` | yes | Public API URL embedded by Vite during image build |

`VITE_*` values are public build-time configuration and are visible in the
browser bundle. Never put passwords, client secrets, or private keys in them.
The outer installer renders all values into the Compose environment before
build/start; none of these deployment values belong in `project.json`.

